20. Find Department With Highest Average Salary

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import avg

df.groupBy("dept") \
  .agg(avg("salary").alias("avg_sal")) \
  .orderBy("avg_sal", ascending=False) \
  .limit(1)

SQL:

SELECT dept,
       AVG(salary) avg_sal
FROM employee
GROUP BY dept
ORDER BY avg_sal DESC
LIMIT 1;
